{
  "uid": "gpu-binpacking-demo",
  "title": "GPU Bin-Packing Demo",
  "tags": ["kube-scheduler-evaluator", "gpu"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "evaluation",
        "label": "Evaluation",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
        "query": "label_values(gpu_utilization_percent, evaluation_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"]}
      },
      {
        "name": "scenario",
        "label": "Scenario",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
        "query": "label_values(gpu_utilization_percent{evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\"}, scenario_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"]}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {"h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## GPU Bin-Packing: utilization-percentage vs free-GPU-count\n\nBoth scenarios replay the **same workload** on a cluster with heterogeneous GPU counts (4 nodes x 8 GPUs, 4 nodes x 1 GPU). `scenario-gpu-binpacking-utilization` packs by GPU **utilization %** and fragments the large nodes, leaving jobs pending. `scenario-gpu-binpacking-freecount` packs by **free GPU count** (best fit) and reaches 100% GPU utilization."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Overall GPU Utilization (%)",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 3},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gpu_utilization_percent{evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\", scenario_id=~\"$scenario\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario_id}} (iteration {{iteration}})"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max", "last"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peak GPU Utilization",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 3},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 85},
              {"color": "green", "value": 99}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max_over_time(gpu_utilization_percent{evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\", scenario_id=~\"$scenario\"}[$__range])",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario_id}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false},
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Allocated GPUs vs Cluster GPU Capacity",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0},
              {"id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": {"dash": [10, 10], "fill": "dash"}}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gpu_allocated_gpus{evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\", scenario_id=~\"$scenario\"}",
          "legendFormat": "allocated - {{scenario_id}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "gpu_capacity_gpus{evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\", scenario_id=~\"$scenario\"}",
          "legendFormat": "capacity - {{scenario_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max", "last"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pending GPU Requests (unschedulable jobs)",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gpu_pending_gpus{evaluation_id=~\"$evaluation\", scenario_id=~\"$scenario\"}",
          "legendFormat": "pending - {{scenario_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max", "last"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    }
  ]
}
